    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.1.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Developmental stages are difficult to align across species.", "Open embryo imaging is concentrated in model organisms rather than whole classes.";
